This product implements the PubGrub version-solving algorithm, described by
Natalie Weizenbaum (https://medium.com/@nex3/pubgrub-2fb6470504f) and in the
documentation of the Dart `pub` package manager (https://github.com/dart-lang/pub),
by Natalie Weizenbaum and the Dart team. Credit for the algorithm belongs to
them; PubGrub was published as prose explicitly so that it could be implemented
across languages, and cross-language ports with credit are the established
pattern in this space.

This implementation is written from that published prose. NO SOURCE FROM ANY
OTHER PUBGRUB IMPLEMENTATION IS INCORPORATED, and none has been read while
writing it. In particular this is not a port or a derivative of
pubgrub-rs/pubgrub, astral-sh/pubgrub, or any Go-language PubGrub
implementation. See CONTRIBUTING.md for the policy, and
.github/workflows/independence.yml for the controls that enforce it.

That statement is deliberate and load-bearing: pubgrub-rs and its forks are
licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, whose file-level copyleft would
attach to derived files. Independence here is a legal property, not a
preference.
